            <div xml:id="d373">

                <pb facs="0466" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1930v01/pg386"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.01/18: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bliss</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-16T14:00:00-04:00">September 16, 1930—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>104. On Thursday, September 18, you will please inform the Foreign Minister that
                    you are instructed by the Government of the <pb facs="0467" n="387"
                        xml:id="pg387"/> United States to enter into full diplomatic relations with
                    the new Argentine Government, thus constituting recognition thereof.</p>
                <p>An announcement of this will be made here late Wednesday afternoon. Until
                    released here, the above should be treated as confidential. Similar action will
                    be taken as to Bolivia and Peru.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
